{"id":2627,"date":"2023-06-15T09:23:20","date_gmt":"2023-06-15T08:23:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?page_id=2627"},"modified":"2026-06-30T14:33:04","modified_gmt":"2026-06-30T13:33:04","slug":"our-partners","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/our-partners\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Partners"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-hero alignfull stk-block-hero stk-has-bottom-separator stk-block stk-2e12352 stk-block-background is-style-default stk--has-background-overlay\" data-v=\"2\" data-block-id=\"2e12352\"><style>.stk-2e12352-inner-blocks{align-items:flex-start !important;justify-content:flex-end !important;}.stk-2e12352 {background-image:url(https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/partners-banner.jpg) !important;background-repeat:no-repeat !important;align-items:flex-end !important;display:flex !important;}.stk-2e12352:before{background-color:#000000 !important;opacity:0.3 !important;}.stk-2e12352 .stk-block-hero__content{min-height:400px !important;align-items:center !important;max-width:1290px !important;min-width:auto !important;display:flex !important;}<\/style><style class=\"stk-custom-css\">.stk-2e12352.stk-block-hero .stk-block-hero__content{align-items:end !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-block-hero__content stk-content-align stk-2e12352-column alignwide stk-container stk-2e12352-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks has-text-align-left stk--column-flex stk-2e12352-inner-blocks\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blue-color has-white-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:10px;font-size:3.7rem\">Our partners<\/h1>\n<\/div><\/div><div class=\"stk-separator stk-separator__bottom\"><div class=\"stk-separator__wrapper\"><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 200\" class=\"stk-separator__layer-1\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1610 78.3c-187 54.4-476.7 89.3-802 89.3-334.7 0-631.8-37-818-94.1v136.8h1620v-132z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-ce499ce\" data-block-id=\"ce499ce\"><style>@media screen and (max-width: 767px){.stk-ce499ce {margin-bottom:50px !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-ce499ce-column alignwide\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-ab4d633\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"ab4d633\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-ab4d633-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-ab4d633-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center page-intro wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:2rem\">CCAC works with top design houses and state primary schools across the country. With the pilot and the demonstration programme behind us we are planning a period of sustained regional growth.&nbsp; Our partnerships cover enterprises in the communities in which our co-design collaborations lie and mutually supportive national organisations.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading title-bar has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-extra-large-font-size\" style=\"background-color:#00b0cc;padding-top:5px;padding-right:50px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:50px\">Schools<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-8061ecc\" data-block-id=\"8061ecc\"><style>.stk-8061ecc {padding-right:50px !important;padding-bottom:0px !important;padding-left:50px !important;margin-top:50px !important;margin-bottom:50px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-8061ecc {padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important;}}@media screen and (max-width: 767px){.stk-8061ecc {margin-top:70px !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-8061ecc-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-8acb7da stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"8acb7da\"><style>.stk-8acb7da {background-color:#def0f5 !important;padding-top:50px !important;}.stk-8acb7da:before{background-color:#def0f5 !important;}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-8acb7da-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-8acb7da-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Primary schools are the nucleus of a radiating web of community activity. &nbsp;They are where children take their first steps into the wider world.&nbsp; Much of what children learn at school filters through to families and friends.&nbsp; The community picks up what is important to the younger, perhaps more imaginative mind, and the dialogue initiates wider enquiry and discussion.&nbsp; Although CCAC\u2019s work is essentially with the schools, our work culminates with a presentation addressing both participants and the local community together with, where possible a public exhibition. We seek partnerships with state schools across the spectrum, but particularly in underserved areas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can find out more about recent examples of our co-design work at partner schools here&#8230;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-divider stk-block-divider stk-block stk-720f6f4 is-style-bar\" data-block-id=\"720f6f4\"><style>.stk-720f6f4 hr.stk-block-divider__hr{background:#ffffff !important;border-radius:calc(2px \/ 2) !important;height:2px !important;width:100% !important;}.stk-720f6f4 {border-radius:0px !important;overflow:hidden !important;box-shadow:none !important;}<\/style><hr class=\"stk-block-divider__hr\"\/><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button btn-white\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/schools-examples\/\">Recent examples<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading title-bar has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-extra-large-font-size\" style=\"background-color:#00b0cc;padding-top:5px;padding-right:50px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:50px\">Designers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-a8ecb6c\" data-block-id=\"a8ecb6c\"><style>.stk-a8ecb6c {padding-right:50px !important;padding-bottom:0px !important;padding-left:50px !important;margin-top:75px !important;margin-bottom:50px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-a8ecb6c {padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-a8ecb6c-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-6b2946a stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"6b2946a\"><style>.stk-6b2946a {background-color:#def0f5 !important;padding-top:50px !important;}.stk-6b2946a:before{background-color:#def0f5 !important;}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-6b2946a-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-6b2946a-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We welcome designers from all disciplines. So far most have come from disciplines that have a close connection with the natural and built environments such as architects, urban and rural designers, engineers, and landscape architects but we have worked with fashion designers and will shortly commence with a product designer basing the co-design on food sourcing, preparation, and consumption.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The designers find the connection with young minds stimulating and rewarding. We work with all sizes of practice. Practices recognise the co-design connection with their Continuous Professional Development (CPD) and Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) commitments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Designers devote a day a week to the CCAC six-week programme.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-divider stk-block-divider stk-block stk-00a4bac is-style-bar\" data-block-id=\"00a4bac\"><style>.stk-00a4bac hr.stk-block-divider__hr{background:#ffffff !important;border-radius:calc(2px \/ 2) !important;height:2px !important;width:100% !important;}.stk-00a4bac {border-radius:0px !important;overflow:hidden !important;box-shadow:none !important;}<\/style><hr class=\"stk-block-divider__hr\"\/><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading title-bar has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-extra-large-font-size\" style=\"background-color:#00b0cc;padding-top:5px;padding-right:50px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:50px\">Young V&amp;A London<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-d8def8e\" data-block-id=\"d8def8e\"><style>.stk-d8def8e {padding-right:50px !important;padding-bottom:0px !important;padding-left:50px !important;margin-top:75px !important;margin-bottom:50px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-d8def8e {padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-d8def8e-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-47f762d stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"47f762d\"><style>.stk-47f762d {background-color:#def0f5 !important;padding-top:50px !important;}.stk-47f762d:before{background-color:#def0f5 !important;}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-47f762d-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-47f762d-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We have worked closely with the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vam.ac.uk\/\">V&amp;A<\/a> from the outset. The museum team helped us with our original pilot, and we have watched the Museum of Childhood at Bethnal Green transform itself into the wonderful <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vam.ac.uk\/young\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Young V&amp;A<\/a>. Now the V&amp;A is going to mount a display in the John Lyons Community Gallery at South Kensington showcasing CCAC\u2019s work and to use it as a case study to inform their Learning Programme. It opens in June 2024 and will run through into 2025.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cCCAC is an exciting, innovative, and visionary charity focused on exploring the sustainability challenge in a manner able to grasp the attention and passion of young people.&nbsp; Its education and co-production programmes entail an understanding of design principles which connect pupils and students to managing and alleviating climate change through equitable and highly creative approaches.\u201d&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Dr Tristram Hunt, Director of the Victoria and Albert Museum<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"776\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/youngva.jpg\" alt=\"The Young V&amp;A\" class=\"wp-image-3848 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768\/776;width:398px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/youngva.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/youngva-297x300.jpg 297w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/youngva-198x200.jpg 198w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/youngva-124x125.jpg 124w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>The central court of Young V&amp;A Bethnal Green.<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading title-bar has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-extra-large-font-size\" style=\"background-color:#00b0cc;padding-top:5px;padding-right:50px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:50px\">Special Advisors<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-aa955a8\" data-block-id=\"aa955a8\"><style>.stk-aa955a8 {padding-right:50px !important;padding-bottom:0px !important;padding-left:50px !important;margin-top:75px !important;margin-bottom:50px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-aa955a8 {padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-aa955a8-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-daf211f stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"daf211f\"><style>.stk-daf211f {background-color:#def0f5 !important;padding-top:50px !important;}.stk-daf211f:before{background-color:#def0f5 !important;}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-daf211f-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-daf211f-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC is working in a complex and fast-changing milieu. Education, climate, technology, and society are all in flux and inextricably linked.&nbsp;We are building up a cohort of special advisors who will at some point coalesce into our advisory board.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-05ce88d\" data-block-id=\"05ce88d\"><style>.stk-05ce88d {margin-bottom:43px !important;}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-05ce88d-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-e1e0a3d\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"e1e0a3d\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-e1e0a3d {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(30% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-e1e0a3d-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-e1e0a3d-inner-blocks\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/iris-lapinski-profile.jpg\" alt=\"Iris Lapinski\" class=\"wp-image-3247 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/iris-lapinski-profile.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/iris-lapinski-profile-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/iris-lapinski-profile-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/iris-lapinski-profile-200x200.jpg 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/iris-lapinski-profile-125x125.jpg 125w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768\/768;\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-8e4b124\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"8e4b124\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-8e4b124 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(70% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-8e4b124-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-8e4b124-inner-blocks\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-teal-color has-text-color\">Iris Lapinski MSc FRSA<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-green-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Expert in developing web-based educational charities and their governance<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Berlin based Iris is the Lead Venture Coach at Bevisioneers, a global fellowship that equips innovators aged 16 to 28 with the training, expert support, and resources to bring their planet-positive projects to life. Previously she was executive director of B Lab Germany, a non-profit network transforming the global economy to benefit people, communities, and planet.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Iris set up and was CEO of award-winning charity, Apps for Good, an open-source education technology programme that lets students build apps and other digital products to solve problems they care about.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Iris holds a BA in Cultural Studies from the European University Viadrina Frankfurt, and an MSc in Human Rights from LSE. Iris is a Fellow of the Royal Society of Arts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-2014f79\" data-block-id=\"2014f79\"><style>.stk-2014f79 {margin-bottom:43px !important;}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-2014f79-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-a8e628c\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"a8e628c\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.st