e-Image-2023-2-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Deb-Outhwaite-Image-2023-2-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Deb-Outhwaite-Image-2023-2-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Deb-Outhwaite-Image-2023-2-200x200.jpg 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Deb-Outhwaite-Image-2023-2-125x125.jpg 125w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-50317c5\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"50317c5\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-50317c5 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(70% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-50317c5-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-50317c5-inner-blocks\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"color: #008c73;\" class=\"stk-highlight\">Dr Deborah Outhwaite SFHEA FRSA FCCT<\/span><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"color: #78b338;\" class=\"stk-highlight\"><strong>Expert in the education system, with interests in leadership and sustainability<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr Deborah Outhwaite is Chair of BELMAS 2023-2026, and has held senior roles in secondary, post-16, and system leadership in England. She has over twenty years of experience of teaching and leading in Higher Education and is currently at the Institute of Education at the University of Liverpool and is a Visiting Senior Fellow at the LSE.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/di